    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Evergreen: carry out an approved action\n\nThe Evergreen app calls this webhook only AFTER a named person approved the action. The call is signed (HMAC-SHA256 of the raw body, header `x-evergreen-signature`); this flow recomputes it and ignores anything that does not match.\n\nThe payload has the customer REF only: no name, email or phone.",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "5589ba89-f476-56e0-b873-089237312cf8",
      "name": "Note: what this is",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -20,
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Swap in your own step\n\nOut of the box the action is posted to Slack when `SLACK_WEBHOOK_URL` is set, otherwise only recorded here (and reported back honestly as such).\n\nReplace or add nodes here: Google Sheets row, CRM task, Gmail DRAFT (not send), Notion, Jira ... Whatever you add, keep the last node reporting back with status `done` or `failed`.",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 430,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "8c52021e-e77b-52a5-8564-467f9749825e",
      "name": "Note: swap in your step",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1100,
        460
      ]
    }
  ],
